{
  "slug": "boss-guide",
  "title": "Expedition 33 Boss Guide - All Bosses in Order",
  "description": "Complete Expedition 33 boss guide with all 165 bosses listed in order by recommended level, locations, types, and combat tips for each act.",
  "keyword": "expedition 33 boss guide",
  "lastUpdated": "2025-12-15",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "boss-overview",
      "title": "Boss Overview",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"/clair-obscur\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Clair Obscur</a>: Expedition 33 contains a staggering 165 boss encounters across three acts, including story bosses, optional overworld bosses, <a href=\"/Enemies\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Chromatic Nevrons</a>, and <a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Endless Tower</a> challenges. Most bosses are optional, hidden at the ends of side passages or roaming the overworld.</p><h3>Boss Types</h3><ul><li><strong>Required:</strong> Story bosses you must defeat to progress. Generally easier than optional content at the same level.</li><li><strong>Optional:</strong> Overworld and side-area bosses with unique rewards (weapons, <a href=\"/best-pictos\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Pictos</a>). Often significantly harder than story content.</li><li><strong>Chromatic:</strong> Enhanced versions of normal enemies with special mechanics. Some only take damage under specific conditions or attack relentlessly until stunned.</li><li><strong><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a>:</strong> Recurring boss type found throughout the game. Intended to be defeated using the Break mechanic (fill yellow meter, then stun).</li></ul><h3>Important Notes</h3><ul><li>Areas marked \"DANGER\" indicate bosses above your current level. The game doesn't tell you the recommended level — use the tables below.</li><li>Optional bosses drop exclusive weapons and Pictos unavailable anywhere else.</li><li>Story bosses are often easier than nearby optional content. Don't judge difficulty by story progression alone.</li><li>You can run past most overworld bosses to grab nearby loot, then return for the fight later.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "act-1-bosses",
      "title": "Act 1 Bosses",
      "content": "<p>Act 1 spans from the Prologue through <a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a>. You'll have access to <a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gustave</a>, <a href=\"/build-lune\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Lune</a>, and <a href=\"/build-maelle\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Maelle</a>, with <a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Sciel</a> joining at <a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gestral Village</a>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Boss</th><th>Location</th><th>Type</th><th>Rec. Level</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/lumiere\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Lumiere</a> (Prologue)</td><td>Optional</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/eveque\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Eveque</a></td><td><a href=\"/spring-meadows\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Spring Meadows</a></td><td>Required</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/spring-meadows\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Spring Meadows</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-lancelier\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Lancelier</a></td><td><a href=\"/spring-meadows\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Spring Meadows</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/jar\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Jar</a></td><td><a href=\"/spring-meadows\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Spring Meadows</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>The <a href=\"/camp-guide\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Curator</a></td><td><a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Flying Waters</a> (The Manor)</td><td>Optional</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/flying-waters\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Flying Waters</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bourgeon</a></td><td><a href=\"/flying-waters\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Flying Waters</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-troubadour\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Troubadour</a></td><td><a href=\"/flying-waters\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Flying Waters</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/goblu\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Goblu</a></td><td><a href=\"/flying-waters\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Flying Waters</a></td><td>Required</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>Grown <a href=\"/bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bourgeon</a></td><td>The Small <a href=\"/bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bourgeon</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/ancient-sanctuary\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Ancient Sanctuary</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/ultimate-sakapatate\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Ultimate Sakapatate</a></td><td><a href=\"/ancient-sanctuary\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Ancient Sanctuary</a></td><td>Required</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/bertrand-big-hands\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bertrand Big Hands</a></td><td>Hidden <a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gestral Arena</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/dominique-giant-feet\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Dominique Giant Feet</a></td><td>Hidden Gestral Arena</td><td>Optional</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/julien-tiny-head\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Julien Tiny Head</a></td><td>Hidden Gestral Arena</td><td>Optional</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Matthieu The Colossus</td><td>Hidden Gestral Arena</td><td>Optional</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/bertrand-big-hands\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bertrand Big Hands</a></td><td><a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>Required</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/dominique-tiny-feet\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Dominique Tiny Feet</a></td><td><a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>Required</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Matthieu The Colossus</td><td><a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>Required</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Sciel</td><td><a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>Required</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/ultimate-sakapatate\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Ultimate Sakapatate</a></td><td><a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Esquie</a>'s Nest</td><td>Optional</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/francois\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Francois</a></td><td>Esquie's Nest</td><td>Required</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-bruler\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Bruler</a></td><td>The Continent (N. of <a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a>)</td><td>Optional</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bourgeon</a></td><td><a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/rocher\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Rocher</a></td><td><a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/lampmaster\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Lampmaster</a></td><td><a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a></td><td>Required</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/white-haired-man\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">White-Haired Man</a></td><td><a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a></td><td>Required</td><td>19</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Act 1 Tips:</strong> The Hidden Gestral Arena bosses (level 15) drop the Last Stand <a href=\"/best-pictos\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Pictos</a> set — essential for Lone Wolf builds. Fight all four to unlock Solo Fighter. Use Maelle to win the Arena tournament for the <a href=\"/medalum\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Medalum</a> weapon.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "act-2-bosses",
      "title": "Act 2 Bosses",
      "content": "<p><a href=\"/sinister-cave\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Act 2</a> begins after <a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a> and introduces <a href=\"/build-verso\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Verso</a> and <a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Monoco</a>. The difficulty ramps significantly, with bosses ranging from level 20 to 43.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Boss</th><th>Location</th><th>Type</th><th>Rec. Level</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"/bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bourgeon</a></td><td>The Continent (Near Meadows)</td><td>Optional</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/yellow-harvest\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Yellow Harvest</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/glaise\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Glaise</a></td><td><a href=\"/yellow-harvest\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Yellow Harvest</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-orphelin\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Orphelin</a></td><td><a href=\"/yellow-harvest\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Yellow Harvest</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bourgeon</a></td><td><a href=\"/forgotten-battlefield\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Forgotten Battlefield</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-luster\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Luster</a></td><td><a href=\"/forgotten-battlefield\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Forgotten Battlefield</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/dualliste\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Dualliste</a></td><td><a href=\"/forgotten-battlefield\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Forgotten Battlefield</a></td><td>Required</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><td>Monoco</td><td><a href=\"/monocos-station\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Monoco's Station</a></td><td>Required</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/stalact\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stalact</a></td><td><a href=\"/monocos-station\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Monoco's Station</a></td><td>Required</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/golgra\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Golgra</a> (vs Monoco)</td><td><a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-danseuse\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Danseuse</a></td><td><a href=\"/old-lumiere\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Old Lumiere</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/old-lumiere\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Old Lumiere</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/renoir\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Renoir</a></td><td><a href=\"/old-lumiere\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Old Lumiere</a></td><td>Required</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-abbest\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Abbest</a></td><td><a href=\"/abbest-cave\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Abbest Cave</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/giant-sapling\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Giant Sapling</a></td><td>Crushing Cavern</td><td>Optional</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a> x2</td><td>The Continent (NW of <a href=\"/old-lumiere\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Old Lumiere</a>)</td><td>Optional</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-ramasseur\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Ramasseur</a></td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/jovial-moissonneuse\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Jovial Moissonneuse</a></td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/seething-boucheclier\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Seething Boucheclier</a></td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/sorrowful-chapelier\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sorrowful Chapelier</a></td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a>/Mask Keeper</td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>Required</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-greatsword-cultist\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Greatsword Cultist</a></td><td><a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>37</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/tisseur\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Tisseur</a></td><td><a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a></td><td>Required</td><td>37</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/glissando\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Glissando</a></td><td><a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a></td><td>Required</td><td>37</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td><a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>37</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a></td><td><a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a></td><td>Required</td><td>37</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-chalier\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Chalier</a></td><td>Sinister Cave</td><td>Optional</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-jar\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Jar</a></td><td>The Continent (SW of White Tree)</td><td>Optional</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-ballet\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Ballet</a></td><td>Falling Leaves</td><td>Optional</td><td>41</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/scavenger\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Scavenger</a></td><td>Falling Leaves</td><td>Optional</td><td>41</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/the-paintress\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">The Paintress</a> (Giant)</td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Optional</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/eveque\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Eveque</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Optional</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-bourgeon\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Bourgeon</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Optional</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/ultimate-sakapatate\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Ultimate Sakapatate</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Optional</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/mime\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mime</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Optional</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/gargant\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gargant</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Required</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/clair-obscur\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Clair Obscur</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Optional</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/renoir\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Renoir</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Required</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/the-paintress\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">The Paintress</a></td><td>The Monolith</td><td>Required</td><td>43</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><a href=\"/sinister-cave\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Act 2</a> Tips:</strong> The <a href=\"/dualliste\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Dualliste</a> drops <a href=\"/dualiso\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Dualiso</a> (Verso's double-turn weapon). <a href=\"/chromatic-luster\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Luster</a> drops Energising <a href=\"/how-to-parry\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Parry</a> <a href=\"/best-pictos\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Pictos</a>. Defeating the <a href=\"/mask-keeper\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mask Keeper</a> in <a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a> gives the Immaculate Pictos (flat damage boost). <a href=\"/sirene\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Sirene</a> drops <a href=\"/tisseron\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Tisseron</a> (<a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Sciel</a>'s Twilight weapon) and unlocks the Energising Turn Pictos.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "act-3-bosses",
      "title": "Act 3 Bosses",
      "content": "<p>Act 3 introduces endgame content including post-story bosses and the <a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Endless Tower</a>. Bosses here range from level 45 to the most challenging fights in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Boss</th><th>Location</th><th>Type</th><th>Rec. Level</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-gault\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Gault</a></td><td><a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a></td><td>Optional</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-hexga\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Hexga</a></td><td><a href=\"/stone-wave-cliffs\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Stone Wave Cliffs</a> Cave</td><td>Optional</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/grosse-tete\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Grosse Tete</a></td><td>The Continent (Outside <a href=\"/coastal-cave\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Coastal Cave</a>)</td><td>Optional</td><td>45+</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Note: Act 3 includes the Endless Tower, a gauntlet of increasingly difficult boss fights. The tower contains some of the most challenging encounters in the game, including Chromatic <a href=\"/lampmaster\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Lampmaster</a> and Clea Unleashed, which drop the best endgame <a href=\"/best-pictos\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Pictos</a> (First Life and Clea's Death respectively).</em></p><h3>Endless Tower Overview</h3><p>The Endless Tower is Expedition 33's ultimate endgame challenge. It features sequential boss fights with escalating difficulty. Prepare with fully upgraded weapons, optimal Pictos loadouts, and mastery of all defensive mechanics. Rewards include the strongest Pictos in the game.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "optional-hidden-bosses",
      "title": "Optional & Hidden Bosses",
      "content": "<h3><a href=\"/Enemies\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Chromatic Nevrons</a></h3><p>Chromatic enemies are enhanced variants with unique mechanics scattered throughout the Continent. They're significantly harder than regular bosses at the same level but drop exclusive rewards.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Chromatic Boss</th><th>Location</th><th>Level</th><th>Notable Drop</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-lancelier\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Lancelier</a></td><td><a href=\"/spring-meadows\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Spring Meadows</a></td><td>5</td><td>Early-game weapon</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-troubadour\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Troubadour</a></td><td><a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Flying Waters</a></td><td>8</td><td>Unique <a href=\"/best-pictos\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Pictos</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-bruler\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Bruler</a></td><td>N. of <a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gestral Village</a></td><td>19</td><td>Fire-type rewards</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-luster\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Luster</a></td><td><a href=\"/forgotten-battlefield\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Forgotten Battlefield</a></td><td>23</td><td>Energising <a href=\"/how-to-parry\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Parry</a> Pictos</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-danseuse\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Danseuse</a></td><td><a href=\"/old-lumiere\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Old Lumiere</a></td><td>28</td><td>Unique weapon</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-ramasseur\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Ramasseur</a></td><td><a href=\"/visages\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Visages</a></td><td>32</td><td>Augmented Counter II</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-jar\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Jar</a></td><td>SW of White Tree</td><td>38</td><td><a href=\"/jarum\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Jarum</a> (<a href=\"/build-maelle\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Maelle</a> weapon)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/chromatic-ballet\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Chromatic Ballet</a></td><td>Falling Leaves</td><td>41</td><td>Late-game Pictos</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Hidden <a href=\"/locations\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gestral Arena</a></h3><p>Found in <a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a>, this arena features four consecutive fights against <a href=\"/bertrand-big-hands\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Bertrand Big Hands</a>, <a href=\"/dominique-giant-feet\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Dominique Giant Feet</a>, <a href=\"/julien-tiny-head\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Julien Tiny Head</a>, and Matthieu The Colossus. Defeating all four unlocks the Solo Fighter Pictos and the full Last Stand Pictos set — essential for Lone Wolf builds.</p><h3>Special Encounters</h3><ul><li><strong><a href=\"/golgra\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Golgra</a> (vs <a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Monoco</a>):</strong> Solo fight at <a href=\"/gestral-village\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Gestral Village</a> (Level 25). Tests Monoco's abilities independently.</li><li><strong><a href=\"/clair-obscur\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Clair Obscur</a>:</strong> Optional boss at The Monolith (Level 43). Named after the game's title — a challenging late-Act 2 encounter.</li><li><strong><a href=\"/the-paintress\" style=\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">The Paintress</a> (Giant):</strong> A massive version encountered optionally at The Monolith before the required story fight.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "general-tips",
      "title": "General Boss Tips",
      "content": "<h3>Before the Fight</h3><ul><li>Check recommended level from the tables above. Being 2-3 levels below is manageable; 5+ below is usually not viable.</li><li>Equip weapons with elements the boss is weak to. Swap loadouts at camp before challenging optional bosses.</li><li>Stock Chroma Elixirs — they fully heal your party mid-fight if needed.</li><li>Equip Energising Start <a href=\"/best-pictos\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Pictos</a> for bonus AP on turn one. The first turn often determines the fight's pace.</li></ul><h3>During the Fight</h3><ul><li><strong><a href=\"/how-to-parry\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Parry</a> over Dodge:</strong> The +1 AP and counterattack damage add up massively over long boss fights. Practice on easier enemies first.</li><li><strong>Apply Defenseless early:</strong> <a href=\"/build-maelle\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Maelle</a>'s Fencer's Flurry or Offensive Switch gives your whole party +25% damage for 3 turns.</li><li><strong>Use the Break system:</strong> Fill the yellow meter with multi-hit skills, then stun the boss for a free damage window with bonus damage taken.</li><li><strong>Watch for Jump Flares:</strong> These CANNOT be Dodged or Parried. You must Jump (A button) to avoid them.</li><li><strong>Gradient Counter on dark screen:</strong> When the screen darkens, an enemy <a href=\"/guide\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Gradient Attack</a> is coming. Use RT for a Gradient Counter.</li></ul><h3>If You're Stuck</h3><ul><li>Level up 2-3 levels and return. Overworld enemies respawn at <a href=\"/camp-guide\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Expedition Flags</a>.</li><li>Upgrade your weapons with <a href=\"/best-weapons\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Chroma Catalysts</a> at camp.</li><li>Swap party composition — some bosses are much easier with specific characters or elements.</li><li>Focus on Parry timing for that specific boss. Each boss has distinct attack patterns to learn.</li></ul>"
    }
  ]
}